OL,5,G2305 The Big Interview: Louis Walsh
OL,6,     FColette Fitzpatrick sits down with
OL,7,     FLouis Walsh to reflect on his
OL,8,     Fcareer managing pop superstars,
OL,9,     Fjudging talent shows and life in
OL,10,     Fthe spotlight.
OL,11,G0005 Stand Up If You're Racist
OL,12,     FMartin Angolo sets out to find
OL,13,     FIreland's funniest immigrant
OL,14,     Fcomedians and stage a
OL,15,     Ffirst-of-its-kind comedy showcase.
OL,16,     FHe just needs a line-up, a venue
OL,17,     Fand some idea what he's doing.
OL,18,G0105 Safe Harbour
OL,19,     FMarco fights for a position in the
OL,20,     FWalsh clan empire, but when Toby
OL,21,     Funcovers the truth, will he cause
OL,22,     Fthe walls to come crashing down.
